      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\nThis seems to be Lisa's final entry. \n\nDated 20/09/75:\n\n\"I'm
        sorry Lisa. I didn't want it to be like this. \n\nI'll be better next time,
        much softer. \nI won't let the dark thoughts get to me.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
