    - target: {fileID: 6475136162391253518, guid: 60f90d43c287b8f44a431e1f3ed64205,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Another torn page of Lisa Moore's diary.\n\nDated 26/06/75:\n\n\"Mom
        and Dad haven't been home for a couple of months, and I guess my letters
        have been sent to the wrong place.\nAt least the lights haven't turned off,
        and Cain still hunts for us every day. \nWhy did they leave us so quickly,
        and where did they go?\nWhy did they abandon us?\nMaybe we didn't love them
        enough.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6475136162391253518, guid: 60f90d43c287b8f44a431e1f3ed64205,
        type: 3}
