    - target: {fileID: 7990644509579573164, guid: 60f90d43c287b8f44a431e1f3ed64205,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '

        This seems to be another torn page of Lisa Moore''s diary.


        Dated
        26/06/75:


        "Cain has been very possessive over me ever since mom
        and dad left.

        He keeps me on a tight schedule, making sure I''m
        not out of the house for too long. I haven''t seen my friends in months.

        Sometimes
        it feels like he watches me when I sleep."'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8061831483294577963, guid: 60f90d43c287b8f44a431e1f3ed64205,
