    - target: {fileID: 8453293826444921813, guid: 60f90d43c287b8f44a431e1f3ed64205,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'I stole this off of that tall, dark figure.


        It looks like
        it could unlock something important, I''m sure that its vital to my search
        for my daughter.


        I hope that I find her soon...'
